  "measured_lines": [
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L001",
      "runtime_id": "4f5a6b65",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "你要娶我，為什麼連公司的事，都要由你決定？",
      "start_sample": 9600,
      "end_sample": 252000,
      "start_s": 0.2,
      "end_s": 5.25,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 5.05,
      "audio_samples": 242400,
      "source_wav_sha256": "d337544eecd01f86fd5118e51b27decb8acb6ef427a1c96790254865e65ee4eb",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/4f5a6b65.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L002",
      "runtime_id": "585129ad",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "棠棠，附件只是替妳省事。",
      "start_sample": 276000,
      "end_sample": 426240,
      "start_s": 5.75,
      "end_s": 8.88,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.13,
      "audio_samples": 150240,
      "source_wav_sha256": "9a95a5b871b89990dc0aea206390c1b958322b592687487190b6430c272c0ef9",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/585129ad.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L003",
      "runtime_id": "7f869663",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "那就念出來。這裡，授權給誰？",
      "start_sample": 450240,
      "end_sample": 641280,
      "start_s": 9.38,
      "end_s": 13.36,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.98,
      "audio_samples": 191040,
      "source_wav_sha256": "7a491b7537df421e6df1f4957d957a25c069d5d5aaa5711355f4489f7bafa843",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/7f869663.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L004",
      "runtime_id": "6e3c27ab",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "受託人……顧承川。",
      "start_sample": 665280,
      "end_sample": 816000,
      "start_s": 13.86,
      "end_s": 17.0,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.14,
      "audio_samples": 150720,
      "source_wav_sha256": "73af38d1620cc768b024ab23b1fac3cd231bf13c5feaec17b609196dd5661e8f",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/6e3c27ab.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L005",
      "runtime_id": "8b4d0a7b",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "再念下一項。",
      "start_sample": 840000,
      "end_sample": 885120,
      "start_s": 17.5,
      "end_s": 18.44,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 0.94,
      "audio_samples": 45120,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ebdafa676068e14a15c525d8663112351530281018a348104c3438b536f3e184",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/8b4d0a7b.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L006",
      "runtime_id": "da7b754c",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "代為行使表決權。",
      "start_sample": 936000,
      "end_sample": 1054080,
      "start_s": 19.5,
      "end_s": 21.96,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.46,
      "audio_samples": 118080,
      "source_wav_sha256": "35b1850e372b658212d8c57921bf176e84fdf34e49d9bf6e724530567910632f",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/da7b754c.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L007",
      "runtime_id": "3c2a1cc2",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "所以，不只是結婚。公司的事，也要由你代我表決。",
      "start_sample": 1078080,
      "end_sample": 1344960,
      "start_s": 22.46,
      "end_s": 28.02,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 5.56,
      "audio_samples": 266880,
      "source_wav_sha256": "50b48eef04acc556442d8df321777577d81993970008902c14ac1e44b1f46848",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/3c2a1cc2.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L008",
      "runtime_id": "e71ea610",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "我幫妳做這些，有什麼不好？",
      "start_sample": 1368960,
      "end_sample": 1498560,
      "start_s": 28.52,
      "end_s": 31.22,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.7,
      "audio_samples": 129600,
      "source_wav_sha256": "51e92a463b599aca05ebfe5f34ad25d62d4885ab93c1394ce3715666167c4289",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/e71ea610.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L009",
      "runtime_id": "62eec78b",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我還沒答應，你就已經替我決定好了？",
      "start_sample": 1522560,
      "end_sample": 1680480,
      "start_s": 31.72,
      "end_s": 35.01,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.29,
      "audio_samples": 157920,
      "source_wav_sha256": "2a2fe590f11e974c8bf140f13d1fe7c24354f418f6967a74191e3b9b402cf9ec",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/62eec78b.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L010",
      "runtime_id": "3f100dd2",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "大家先坐下。棠棠，有話好好說。",
      "start_sample": 1704480,
      "end_sample": 1908960,
      "start_s": 35.51,
      "end_s": 39.77,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.26,
      "audio_samples": 204480,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ab9c2aea12ffb6607990ed1c5eee419aea9e8b43d2d31299bfb72986b3ab892b",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/3f100dd2.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L011",
      "runtime_id": "c3ba746c",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "兩家的親友都在。妳這樣問，讓我怎麼交代？",
      "start_sample": 1932960,
      "end_sample": 2138880,
      "start_s": 40.27,
      "end_s": 44.56,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.29,
      "audio_samples": 205920,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ea85443620e9b372f35c20a94ebb528d01629d7f520343388bd535b5e5397779",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/c3ba746c.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L012",
      "runtime_id": "f30fa2e0",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我問文件，你卻只問我讓誰難看。",
      "start_sample": 2162880,
      "end_sample": 2334720,
      "start_s": 45.06,
      "end_s": 48.64,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.58,
      "audio_samples": 171840,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ffef278444edbe44c193d00fb2b4d60f665dc1dd106c0d361900c6b5308dda4a",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/f30fa2e0.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L013",
      "runtime_id": "b1ac905b",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "他也是想替妳分擔。今天不用把話說得這麼重。",
      "start_sample": 2358720,
      "end_sample": 2591040,
      "start_s": 49.14,
      "end_s": 53.98,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.84,
      "audio_samples": 232320,
      "source_wav_sha256": "e7c7ee0a3cf9c4d89c262204fd31b140e500caaaa4ea14904a2e4b03ded2badc",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/b1ac905b.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L014",
      "runtime_id": "f2016028",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "舅舅，表決權是我的。我得知道要交給誰。",
      "start_sample": 2615040,
      "end_sample": 2842560,
      "start_s": 54.48,
      "end_s": 59.22,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.74,
      "audio_samples": 227520,
      "source_wav_sha256": "751801ff2063daf3fa56edc68b87a6555ab002409e28404c41f8b572521ae836",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/f2016028.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L015",
      "runtime_id": "c4427b3d",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "這份授權書，是你拿來的，對嗎？",
      "start_sample": 2866560,
      "end_sample": 3023520,
      "start_s": 59.72,
      "end_s": 62.99,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.27,
      "audio_samples": 156960,
      "source_wav_sha256": "6695528eec9d0cf82c0e0224445e3bfad7f0806a13b82c117a02af2b6f9bd15a",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/c4427b3d.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L016",
      "runtime_id": "fccfbc0e",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "是我準備的。不是怕妳太累嗎？",
      "start_sample": 3047520,
      "end_sample": 3276480,
      "start_s": 63.49,
      "end_s": 68.26,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.77,
      "audio_samples": 228960,
      "source_wav_sha256": "e5158fa4abc9cce77d7ab6e0242054e8d92d6215e201aeac8b84ae3105634e02",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/fccfbc0e.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L017",
      "runtime_id": "138330a2",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "好。那今天放在這裡的原件，就先留下。",
      "start_sample": 3300480,
      "end_sample": 3516000,
      "start_s": 68.76,
      "end_s": 73.25,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.49,
      "audio_samples": 215520,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ffa6135c27daa3c541c011fb8111591baa8359860d52217a2571dbf54cf17fdb",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/138330a2.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L018",
      "runtime_id": "9fa4827e",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "婚禮已經停了，文件還留著做什麼？",
      "start_sample": 3540000,
      "end_sample": 3706080,
      "start_s": 73.75,
      "end_s": 77.21,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.46,
      "audio_samples": 166080,
      "source_wav_sha256": "779ad985b86ae291de8b363c4b05d33522006fd4519d9e97e01e99de339550d2",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/9fa4827e.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L019",
      "runtime_id": "303aced7",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "你說只是省事，我也想找人把它看清楚。",
      "start_sample": 3730080,
      "end_sample": 3916320,
      "start_s": 77.71,
      "end_s": 81.59,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.88,
      "audio_samples": 186240,
      "source_wav_sha256": "4f04588229e65ae7f78f18ff63fe50f75ed8e298473585ce96b0b8582cab8109",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/303aced7.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L020",
      "runtime_id": "7fb21181",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "拿出去，別人會怎麼想沈家？",
      "start_sample": 3940320,
      "end_sample": 4085760,
      "start_s": 82.09,
      "end_s": 85.12,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.03,
      "audio_samples": 145440,
      "source_wav_sha256": "d0dce0d8b139001fc642114c4f040457db059cff9adae1d75677cc79dab4e33d",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/7fb21181.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L021",
      "runtime_id": "3485f962",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "讓我不看、不問，才叫替我著想嗎？",
      "start_sample": 4109760,
      "end_sample": 4310880,
      "start_s": 85.62,
      "end_s": 89.81,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.19,
      "audio_samples": 201120,
      "source_wav_sha256": "a3b72d0f40a7058624315fd6599473d4926fffb4d0382d58272fabbf4bb8625a",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/3485f962.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L022",
      "runtime_id": "059a0c43",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "請把這份完整原件封存。附件也一起。",
      "start_sample": 4334880,
      "end_sample": 4518240,
      "start_s": 90.31,
      "end_s": 94.13,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.82,
      "audio_samples": 183360,
      "source_wav_sha256": "ff7c22a8b4e4407830aaf568ce45004609e4fff54a6421f1d8f613edcfa47791",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/059a0c43.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L023",
      "runtime_id": "13d7f541",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "妳連這點信任都不肯給？",
      "start_sample": 4710240,
      "end_sample": 4818720,
      "start_s": 98.13,
      "end_s": 100.39,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.26,
      "audio_samples": 108480,
      "source_wav_sha256": "b9921de1245ce6d2e68e60a6303a1b8be5e0101c057ce6175b6536b59a9dcc37",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/13d7f541.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L024",
      "runtime_id": "2e8e9caf",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "原件不交給你，也不交給我。",
      "start_sample": 4842720,
      "end_sample": 4985760,
      "start_s": 100.89,
      "end_s": 103.87,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.98,
      "audio_samples": 143040,
      "source_wav_sha256": "dbb9a489914f3ac76d18078a703cd2410d6e62d47680775465ab9c1c890eb15c",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/2e8e9caf.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L025",
      "runtime_id": "b22d86aa",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "請你們帶回保管，給我一張保管收據。",
      "start_sample": 5009760,
      "end_sample": 5174400,
      "start_s": 104.37,
      "end_s": 107.8,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.43,
      "audio_samples": 164640,
      "source_wav_sha256": "82402bc57061af478be2a349bf9aef773865a74847b47020822ec8179c12d50f",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/b22d86aa.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L026",
      "runtime_id": "ffd6bd8e",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我手上這份完整副本，我自己留著。",
      "start_sample": 5366400,
      "end_sample": 5518080,
      "start_s": 111.8,
      "end_s": 114.96,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.16,
      "audio_samples": 151680,
      "source_wav_sha256": "c57cb57cbe4d5e613ca001bbd62299485f40c31a972db98017280eef89bbc707",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/ffd6bd8e.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L027",
      "runtime_id": "a4fa1702",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "棠棠，非得在今天走到這一步嗎？",
      "start_sample": 5710080,
      "end_sample": 5890080,
      "start_s": 118.96,
      "end_s": 122.71,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.75,
      "audio_samples": 180000,
      "source_wav_sha256": "1411c08a8f4abddfc381238a882cd77a7d559e574ca991962b9d09c8862fc21b",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/a4fa1702.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L028",
      "runtime_id": "2e2bab84",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "是你選在今天，叫我把字簽下去。",
      "start_sample": 5914080,
      "end_sample": 6115680,
      "start_s": 123.21,
      "end_s": 127.41,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.2,
      "audio_samples": 201600,
      "source_wav_sha256": "29d4dd37b1215e75c9796600dedadaa65a157ab9d8e68ce41ea2225581533527",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/2e2bab84.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L029",
      "runtime_id": "838cbadc",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "先讓客人安心。文件的事，我來跟妳說。",
      "start_sample": 6571680,
      "end_sample": 6767520,
      "start_s": 136.91,
      "end_s": 140.99,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.08,
      "audio_samples": 195840,
      "source_wav_sha256": "15ac4823848f5800c790ce025ae579d799d783d8162a3a94cdd68ddb02994a8e",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/838cbadc.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L030",
      "runtime_id": "cf075fb6",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "可以。但我不會再沒看清楚就簽。",
      "start_sample": 6791520,
      "end_sample": 6936960,
      "start_s": 141.49,
      "end_s": 144.52,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.03,
      "audio_samples": 145440,
      "source_wav_sha256": "8787655cd7776beeeb185c57467060b0db56b8ebcb2d551598016dcceddfa763",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/cf075fb6.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L031",
      "runtime_id": "e174c140",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "妳就這麼信不過自己人？",
      "start_sample": 6960960,
      "end_sample": 7079040,
      "start_s": 145.02,
      "end_s": 147.48,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.46,
      "audio_samples": 118080,
      "source_wav_sha256": "7ce0c1fb344d8748b520eabb075cc230fabc0f2aa5d9c37d5a7270e009c2348d",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/e174c140.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L032",
      "runtime_id": "f093949d",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我信過。所以這一次，我要問清楚。",
      "start_sample": 7103040,
      "end_sample": 7273920,
      "start_s": 147.98,
      "end_s": 151.54,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.56,
      "audio_samples": 170880,
      "source_wav_sha256": "2f38f66bff17dcc9807b5134bea293632c5d45315b6623a60da2779a71bef2cf",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/f093949d.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L033",
      "runtime_id": "92cd5bfe",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "好，我願意解釋。",
      "start_sample": 7297920,
      "end_sample": 7392000,
      "start_s": 152.04,
      "end_s": 154.0,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.96,
      "audio_samples": 94080,
      "source_wav_sha256": "2215bb9c54aa9b0383f0dc46744b0977b8617bdc34f57c5294ffecb3c6f2cfbb",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e02-voice-zh-tw/audio/92cd5bfe.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E02-L034",
      "runtime_id": "97b494f9",
      "speaker_id": "chongyue",
      "text": "先把相機都關掉。",
